      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
MWH will be reported for Jersey Central Power &amp; Light by PJM Interconnection in the FERC Form 582.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHFE0418DCB3ED216BBD6CEB0825EAAE69" xlink:to="HHF6D9E9560D96506CF65BC1F6E1C05EA1" order="1" />
