      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
MWH will be reported for Jersey Central Power &amp; Light by PJM Interconnection in the FERC Form 582.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHBB97E3E885560D78ECAFA6AD78CA7E4F" xlink:to="HH06947B72177B5AE24E670B9E959CBF01" order="1" />
